You are working on issue #ISSUE_NUM in the EmuSync workflow.

## Your Task: Issue Skill

Parse the user's description of this issue. Determine:
1. A clear, concise title (1 line, imperative, no prefix tags)
2. A summary (1-2 sentences)
3. The motivation (why this matters)
4. Reproduction steps or expected behavior
5. Which areas of the codebase are affected
6. Acceptance criteria (checklist)

## Actions

### 1. Create the GitHub issue
Run this command to create the issue:
- run: gh issue create --repo <repo> --title "<title>" --body-file <temp-file> --label enhancement

Build the issue body from the summary, motivation, steps, affected area, and acceptance criteria.

### 2. Write the handoff file
Write the full handoff file using the format below. This creates/replaces `plans/<N>-handoff.md`:

create-file: plans/<N>-handoff.md
```markdown
# Handoff: <title>

## Metadata
- Issue: #N
- Branch: feature/<N>-step
- PR: none
- Status: issue_done
- Created: <today's date>
- Fix attempts: 0

## 1. Issue
### Summary
<summary>

### Motivation
<motivation>

### Steps to reproduce / expected behavior
<steps>

### Affected area
<affected area with specific file/dir references>

### Acceptance criteria
- [ ] <criterion 1>
- [ ] <criterion 2>

## 2. Design
### Scope: TBD
### Backend Changes: TBD
### UI Changes: TBD
### Sub-issues: TBD
### Difficulty: TBD/10
### Backwards Compatibility: TBD

## 3. Frontend Plan
### Design Alignment: TBD
### Visual Pattern: TBD
### Recommendations: TBD

## 4. Backend Plan
### Design Alignment: TBD
### Backend Pattern: TBD
### Recommendations: TBD

## 5. Merged Plan
### Conflicts Resolved: none
### Unresolved Conflicts: none

## 6. Testing Plan
### Test File: TBD
### Test Cases: TBD
### Edge Cases: TBD
### Integration Points: TBD

## 7. Test Design
### Test Scope: TBD
### Test Types: TBD
### Test Cases: TBD
### Affected Existing Tests: TBD
### Implementation Checklist: TBD

## 8. Implementation Steps
### Steps: TBD

## 9. Review
### Findings: TBD
### Blocked: TBD
### Blockers: TBD

## 10. Ship
### Status: pending
### PR: none
### Server Sync: pending
### Doc Sync: pending

## 11. Fix Attempts
### Attempt 1: none
### Attempt 2: none
### Attempt 3: none

## 12. Log
- <date> issue: workflow initialized
- <date> issue_done: issue created, handoff populated
```

Rules:
- Keep the summary concise but complete
- Affected area should reference specific directories/files
- Acceptance criteria must be testable (checkbox items)
- Title: short, imperative, no prefix tags like "Feature:" or "Bug:"
- Do NOT write code changes here — that comes in later skills
